OL,3,GNEWSADrivers using roads as a race
OL,4,Atrack say villagers
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople living in a village say their
OL,7,Fweekend evenings, once punctuated by
OL,8,Fthe soothing sounds of nature, are
OL,9,Fbeing increasingly disturbed by the
OL,10,Fsound of high powered cars racing down
OL,11,Ftheir roads.
OL,13,FResidents of Cookham say the problems
OL,14,Fstarted in the Covid lockdowns but have
OL,15,Fbeen getting worse in the last few
OL,16,Fmonths.
OL,18,FThames Valley Police says its now
OL,19,Fidentified Winter Hill as an official
OL,20,Fhotspot for anti-social behaviour and
OL,21,Fexcessive driving speeds and is putting
OL,22,Fextra resources into the area.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,332,330,200,160,0,100
